1. Product Vision
Manii is an AI-powered manifestation companion that helps users reprogram their subconscious through personalized audio experiences.
Unlike generic manifestation apps or YouTube recordings, Manii creates completely personalized content based on each user’s unique goals, circumstances and desired future.
Rather than being just an audio generator, Manii becomes an intelligent companion that understands every area of a user’s life and continuously creates highly personalised manifestation experiences.
The product should feel calm, premium, intelligent and effortless.
The design philosophy is inspired by the simplicity of ChatGPT, the polish of Apple, and the calming atmosphere of modern meditation apps.
⸻
2. Core Philosophy
Manifestation is not simply listening to affirmations.
It is consistently entering the emotional state of already having your desired reality.
Manii exists to make this effortless.
The app should become something users open every day—not because they have to, but because it feels like part of their identity.
Every feature should answer one question:
“Does this help the user believe, feel or embody their desired reality?”
If not, it doesn’t belong.
