10A. Sleep Experience
Sleep is a foundational pillar of Manii.
The purpose of the Sleep experience is not to compete directly with dedicated sleep tracking applications.
Instead, it exists to strengthen Manii’s core mission:
Helping users optimise their subconscious mind during sleep.
Manifestation is simply the primary application of that mission.
Every sleep feature should reinforce one or more of the following:
Better sleep habits
Greater consistency
Stronger nightly routines
Improved subconscious conditioning
Increased daily engagement
The Sleep experience should feel calming, encouraging and insightful rather than clinical or overwhelming.
⸻
Core Sleep Philosophy
Rather than presenting users with large amounts of scientific data, Manii focuses on actionable and emotionally meaningful insights.
Users should finish every morning feeling that they are making progress—not analysing spreadsheets.
Where traditional sleep apps ask:
“How did you sleep?”
Manii asks:
“How prepared is your mind for tonight’s subconscious conditioning?”
⸻
Sleep Dashboard
The Sleep tab should become a personalised morning dashboard.
Example layout:
Good Morning
Sleep Duration
Sleep Quality
Subconscious Readiness
Listening Completion
Sleep Consistency
