Rather than presenting raw numbers alone, every metric should include meaningful AI-generated explanations that connect the user’s sleep habits with their nightly routine.
⸻
Apple Health Integration
Apple Health should be deeply integrated into the product.
Whenever permission is granted, Manii should automatically import available sleep data to reduce user friction.
Imported data may include:
Sleep duration
Bedtime
Wake time
