Time in bed
Apple Health should become the primary source of sleep information whenever available.
Users should never have to manually enter sleep data.
⸻
Smart Alarm
The Smart Alarm is one of Manii’s flagship premium features.
Using available sleep information, Manii attempts to wake the user during an appropriate wake window rather than at a single fixed moment.
The objective is to help users wake feeling more refreshed while naturally extending the nightly manifestation routine into the morning.
The wake-up experience should feel calm and intentional.
Example flow:
Gentle ambient audio fades in.
Optional narrator voice greets the user.
Morning Briefing begins.
Alarm ends naturally.
⸻
Morning Briefing
Every morning Manii generates a personalised briefing.
This should become one of the product’s signature experiences.
The briefing combines:
Previous night’s sleep
Current Journeys
