Listening completion
Sleep consistency
Upcoming recommendations
Example:
“Good morning. You slept for 7 hours and 42 minutes and completed your entire listening session. Your consistency has improved throughout the week, creating excellent conditions for tonight’s subconscious conditioning. Based on your recent conversations, I’ve slightly refined tonight’s Financial Freedom Journey. Have an amazing day.”
Every briefing should feel personal, encouraging and unique.
