15. Monetisation Strategy
Manii operates on a premium subscription model designed to maximise long-term customer value while maintaining healthy AI margins.
The business model is built around an evolving AI companion rather than a one-time content generator.
Users are not subscribing to create audio.
They are subscribing to an AI that continuously understands them better, evolves alongside their journey, and creates increasingly personalised subconscious experiences.
⸻
15.1 Three-Day Premium Trial
Rather than offering a permanent free tier, every new user receives a 3-day Premium Trial.
Access to the trial requires selecting a subscription plan and providing payment information before the trial begins.
The user will not be charged until the trial expires.
This approach allows users to experience the full premium product while significantly increasing conversion rates compared to a restricted free tier.
The trial includes:
Full Premium experience
Up to 20 AI conversations
2 premium audio generations
Maximum audio length of 30 minutes
1 active Journey
Once any trial limit is reached, users are prompted to subscribe immediately or wait until their trial period ends.
⸻
15.2 Why No Permanent Free Tier
Manii intentionally avoids a permanent free plan.
Reasons include:
Preventing unlimited AI costs.
Reducing abuse through multiple account creation.
Creating urgency to subscribe.
Maintaining the perception of Manii as a premium product.
The free trial is designed to demonstrate value without creating an ongoing operational cost.
