17. AI Generation Credit System
Instead of limiting users by the number of audios they may create, Manii uses an AI Credit System.
Credits are consumed whenever AI generation incurs a meaningful operational cost.
Examples include:
SATS generation
Guided meditation generation
Subliminal creation
Long-form audio generation
Future premium AI features
Conversation with Manii AI remains effectively unlimited under a fair usage policy and does not normally consume generation credits.
This provides flexibility for future pricing while ensuring AI costs remain predictable.
Unused credits do not roll over unless explicitly included as a future subscription benefit.
Additional credit packs may be purchased separately.
Example packs:
Small Credit Pack
Medium Credit Pack
Large Credit Pack
This allows power users to continue creating content without upgrading to a higher subscription tier.
⸻
18. Subscription Philosophy
The subscription is intentionally designed around continuous value rather than ownership of generated content.
Users are subscribing to an AI companion that:
Learns continuously.
Remembers every Journey.
Adapts to life changes.
Creates increasingly personalised content.
Evolves alongside the user.
Generated audio belongs to the user.
If a subscription is cancelled:
Users retain access to previously generated audio for playback.
However, subscription-only features become unavailable, including:
New AI conversations
New content generation
Journey memory updates
AI coaching
Future sleep tracking features
Ongoing product improvements
This creates goodwill by allowing users to keep what they have already created while maintaining a compelling reason to remain subscribed.
⸻
19. Business Principles
Every monetisation decision should satisfy the following principles:
Deliver genuine value before requesting payment.
Keep AI operational costs significantly below subscription revenue.
Encourage long-term subscriptions over one-time purchases.
Avoid manipulative pricing or dark patterns.
Allow users to retain access to content they have already created.
Reward long-term customers with continual product improvements rather than locking essential functionality behind increasingly expensive plans.
The objective is to build a sustainable subscription business where users continue paying because Manii becomes an indispensable part of their daily manifestation practice—not because they fear losing access to their existing content.
⸻
20. Success Metric
The goal is not simply to create audio.
The goal is for users to feel that Manii genuinely understands them.
When someone thinks:
“I couldn’t imagine using anyone else’s manifestation app.”
then Manii has succeeded.

